gpt_sovits_text
===============

This crate contains a Rust translation of code from the following projects.

PaddleSpeech zh_normalization (Apache License 2.0)
--------------------------------------------------

src/zh_normalization/ and data/zh_normalization/ are translated to Rust from
the `zh_normalization` package of PaddleSpeech
(https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleSpeech, paddlespeech/t2s/frontend/zh_normalization)
in the copy vendored by GPT-SoVITS at commit 04a44eb
(https://github.com/RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS, GPT_SoVITS/text/zh_normalization),
including the GPT-SoVITS modifications to that copy.

Copyright (c) 2020-2021 PaddlePaddle Authors. All Rights Reserved.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

Changes: the Python modules char_convert.py, chronology.py, constants.py,
num.py, phonecode.py, quantifier.py and text_normlization.py were translated
to Rust. The literal character tables of char_convert.py were moved verbatim
into data/zh_normalization/. Python exceptions are returned as
`zh_normalization::Error` values.

PaddleSpeech tone_sandhi (Apache License 2.0)
---------------------------------------------

src/tone_sandhi.rs is translated to Rust from GPT_SoVITS/text/tone_sandhi.py
(GPT-SoVITS commit 04a44eb), which is PaddleSpeech's
paddlespeech/t2s/frontend/tone_sandhi.py with GPT-SoVITS modifications.

Copyright (c) 2021 PaddlePaddle Authors. All Rights Reserved.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

g2pW (Apache License 2.0)
-------------------------

src/g2pw/ is translated to Rust from GPT_SoVITS/text/g2pw (GPT-SoVITS commit
04a44eb), which is derived from g2pW (https://github.com/GitYCC/g2pW) and
pypinyin-g2pW (https://github.com/mozillazg/pypinyin-g2pW).

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

ESPnet (Apache License 2.0)
---------------------------

japanese::pyopenjtalk_g2p_prosody and japanese::_numeric_feature_by_regex
are translated from GPT_SoVITS/text/japanese.py, which copied them from ESPnet
(https://github.com/espnet/espnet, espnet2/text/phoneme_tokenizer.py).

Copyright 2017 Johns Hopkins University (Shinji Watanabe)

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE).

MeCab, as bundled with Open JTalk (BSD 3-Clause)
------------------------------------------------

Parts of src/japanese.rs (the user dictionary tokenizer: tokenizeCSV,
unknown word processing and max-grouping-size handling) are translated to
Rust from MeCab as bundled with Open JTalk
(https://github.com/r9y9/open_jtalk, src/mecab/src/utils.cpp,
tokenizer.cpp, viterbi.cc), which pyopenjtalk uses.

Copyright (c) 2001-2008, Taku Kudo
Copyright (c) 2004-2008, Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corporation

Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License (see LICENSE-MECAB).

Data files (Apache License 2.0)
-------------------------------

data/g2pw/tokenizer.json is the tokenizer of hfl/chinese-roberta-wwm-ext-large
(https://huggingface.co/hfl/chinese-roberta-wwm-ext-large), Apache-2.0.
data/g2pw/opencc/ contains dictionaries from OpenCC 1.4.2
(https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC), Apache-2.0. See data/g2pw/README.md.
